<p>This makes no sense to me. I’m don’t math too good but isn’t the Fibonacci sequence a set number? So you’re multiplying that number by the number of days past this future date? Wouldn’t the report pretty quickly say that everyone has died of dysentery? And if that’s the point, then why? Are you trying to contain the knowledge that dysentery isn’t a thing past that date? Also why?</p>
<p>Honestly, I feel like this is too much confusion for what seems like an “Oregon Trail” reference. Sorry but -1.</p>

