<p>Fibonacci sequence is an infinite sequence of progressively larger numbers, not a single number.<br />
Specifically, the next term in the sequence is the sum of the previous two terms:</p>
<p>1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, &#8230;.and so on</p>
<p>Fibonnacci(n) means the nth number in the series. So on day 6 they look at the 6th number in Fibonacci sequence, and get 8. Then tell the world 8 people died of dysentery.</p>

